===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ḱey-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|cimiterie}}, from {{der|en|fro|cimitiere}}, from {{der|en|ML.|cimitērium}}, from {{der|en|LL.|coemētērium}}, from {{der|en|grc|κοιμητήριον}}, from {{m|grc|κοιμάω|t=I put to sleep}}; compare {{m|en|cœmeterium}}. {{displaced|enm|charnel|t=mass grave, cemetary}} and {{ncog|ang|līctūn|t=cemetary}}.

